<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		 Verb, 
			Act.
		 only impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow, trickle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυσι
			μῦρον</span> they <i>trickled</i> with tears, of poisoned
			arrows, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				132
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> elsewh.
			always in 
				Med.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρομαι</span></b>  (in early 
				Ep.
			 only pres. and impf.), <i>melt
				into tears, shed tears</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέες δ᾽ ἀμφ᾽ αὐτὸν ἑταῖροι μύρονθ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαίοντέ τε μυρομένω τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.427
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοόωσά τε μυρομένη τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.373
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.119
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεὸν μύρετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					206
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1 opt. 2sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρηαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later, of a
			river, <i>flow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥείθροισι . . μύρεται Σίνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					982
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.372
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματι μ.</span>
			<i>trickle</i> with blood, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.666
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>weep for, bewail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.68
			</span></i>: aor. 1
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρασθαι</span> and
				3sg.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμύρατο</span> (s. v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				90
			</span></i>.</div>
